                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 402,
                      "content": "◐ = Funded: in that account, not paid. The chip row's trailing slot says where (\"in Mandiri\", accent-text). Auto items show a ringed bolt once their account covers the debit; an Envelope's tray turns accent once its allowance is moved. FundedNotice counts Funded Fixed items only (manual + Auto) — 3 items · Rp 10.706.000 — because an envelope has nothing left to pay.",
