              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r5h8tn",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$color/text",
                  "content": "M · Plan sort — order the plan by Account, Group, Due day, Status or Name",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Mfh6F",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "docs/prd/plan-sort.md. The PLAN · N ITEMS header carries a trailing Menu named after the active order; its six choices sit under an \"Order the plan by\" title with a checkmark on the active one. Amount (default, unchanged), Due day and Name stay one flat card; Account, Group and Status split it into one section per group, headed by a glyph + NAME · N ITEMS — groups by planned total ↓ (Unassigned / Ungrouped last) or Todo → Funded → Done, items inside by due day in cycle. Rows are unchanged in every order. Session-only: relaunch, paging ‹ › (even back to the same cycle) and the Funded filter all reset to Amount; switching lens keeps it. Dormant rows are never sorted. Sample = one 12-item plan, payday 25 (cycle 25 Oct → 24 Nov), drawn in every order. M2–M5 show the full scroll length.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
