                      "content": "L6, unchanged. Tapping the funded notice resets the order to Amount and the header drops its sort Menu — PLAN · 3 OF 14 ITEMS has nothing trailing. ✕ clears the filter and leaves Amount; the earlier order is not restored. Paging ‹ › to another cycle resets to Amount the same way.",
