                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mSAPK",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$color/text",
                  "content": "N · Filter by plan — show only Outside plan or only From plan, in List and Month",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JT00h",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "docs/prd/plan-filter.md. The two legend entries under the split bar become outlined chips — buttons in List and in Month: tap Outside plan or From plan to narrow the cycle to that half; tap the lit one again for All, the other to switch. The lit chip takes its half's colour as stroke + wash and a checkmark; nothing dims. While a filter is on, a glass PlanFilterPill ('● Outside plan only ✕') floats above the tab bar and clears it. SPENDING stays the whole cycle. List: days with no matching row disappear and day headers add up the visible rows. Month: cells show the half's day totals, weighted against the half's heaviest day, and the day list follows. An empty half is still tappable and says so, naming the half. Session-only: relaunch and any ‹ › page reset to All; List ⇄ Month keeps it; Plan, Search and Person detail ignore it. Sample = August 2026 (31/07 – 30/08), today Thu 6 Aug: SPENDING Rp 4.570.000 = Outside plan Rp 55.000 + From plan Rp 4.515.000.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
