                      "content": "From plan in Month, landing on the default day: today (6 Aug) is in the cycle, so it stays selected even though its only expense (Transport) is outside the plan. The day keeps its 'Today · Rp 0' header and the card says so, naming the half and how to get everything back. Tap 2 Aug → its Makan · Hidup row (Rp 120.000).",
