        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "iPnnx",
          "name": "Flow O · Insights drill-in, plan filter and pay periods",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 28,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "z5cP5",
              "name": "Flow Header",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TfN7X",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$color/text",
                  "content": "O · Insights drill-in, plan filter and past pay periods",
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pvXLP",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "Built 2026-10-03 (docs/prd/insights-drill-in.md, Status: Built). Builds Flow K (option A) and adds two things the owner asked for: the Outside plan / From plan filter on Insights and on the drill-in, and a Menu of past pay periods that replaces the Payday stepper (the chip becomes \"Pay period\"). Insights gains a SPENDING card carrying the split chips from Flow N; the drill-in carries the filter, the chip and the cycle, and has its own split card under the chips. One sample, payday 31, today Thu 6 Aug 2026: June 4.350.000 (all plan), July 4.515.000 (165.000 outside), August 4.570.000 (55.000 outside). Only August's plan has the Hidup envelope, so Makan is Outside plan in July and From plan in August. O10–O12 are Flow K's edge states, kept with their own sample.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
