                      "content": "Each tap cycles a row Off → Only → Hidden → Off, applied at once with the selection haptic. Hidden wears nosign in the negative red and dims the name to secondary; Only keeps the accent check; Off the empty circle. Uncategorized cycles the same way. Clear Category clears Only and Hidden in this row. VoiceOver reads a hidden row's value as “Hidden”.",
