                      "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Select mode (List lens only) turns rows into a checklist: Select All leads, Done trails, and a bar replaces the tab bar with “N selected” and Move to envelope… (disabled at 0). Since flow R it is entered by long-pressing a row (R1), which arrives with that row checked; there is no Select button. Select All takes every visible, selectable row — after the plan and expense filters. Rows a Fixed item created are dimmed, with no circle. Paging or a lens switch leaves select mode. Search is hidden while selecting.",
