                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "docs/prd/envelope-assignment.md §4.5, §4.6, §4.8, §4.9 (amendment to flow Q). The List lens has no Select button: long-press any expense row — List, Month, Search, Person detail, Insights drill-in — for Select (List lens only, opens Q7 with that row checked), Move to envelope… (when the row's own cycle has an active envelope; Q8 titled “Move 1 expense”), Edit and Delete. A row a Fixed item created offers Edit and Delete only; while selecting, rows have no menu. The envelope's ＋ is a menu — New expense · Move expenses here… — and the second opens a sheet listing every expense of the cycle that does not count in that envelope yet, each with its tag, to tick and move at once. Built 13 Oct 2026; on device the menu subtitles sit under each item, and a floor on the meta text keeps a word like “Cash” whole in narrow rows (the tag truncates instead).",
