                      "content": "§4.10.1, §4.10.5. The ticket stays in October by its date: listed, in the Rp 16.740.000 total, and Outside plan — October's plan never held it, and it counts in no October envelope. Its tag has a dashed violet outline and an arrow, “Travelling · Nov”, so it does not read like an ordinary envelope tag, which is From plan. VoiceOver: “Paid early, Travelling, November”. From plan only hides it; Outside plan only shows it, tag and all.",
