                      "content": "§4.10.1, §4.10.6. November's plan exists because the owner paged the Plan lens forward. Travelling counts the ticket dated 14 Oct: Rp 1.200.000 of Rp 2.000.000, Rp 800.000 left — and the drift strip would count an overspend. A caption under the legend says where it came from: “Rp 1.200.000 paid early in October” (the month only when every such expense comes from one cycle). November's List lens never lists the ticket. Hidup and Kebutuhan Kos have nothing yet.",
