                      "content": "§4.10.8. Opened from ＋ › Move expenses here… on November's Travelling, on 14 Oct. November has no expenses yet, so its own section is not drawn; October — today's cycle, before the envelope's — follows under “PAID EARLY · OCTOBER 2026”, grouped by day, newest first. The ticket still counts by Category (no tag, Outside plan). Moving it makes it paid early. Ended cycles are never offered.",
