                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TCKQo",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "docs/prd/envelope-detail.md. Built 14 Oct 2026, no schema change. Tapping an active Envelope row opens its detail as a .large sheet instead of the plan item editor, which moves behind Edit; Fixed and dormant rows keep their taps. EnvelopeDetailCard restates the row — spent of planned, the bar, the paid-early caption, the claimed Categories — with the row's violet EnvelopeAddMenu. Below it every expense EnvelopeClaims counts in this envelope (envelope(for:) for its own cycle, paidEarly(into:) for earlier ones), totalling EnvelopeProgress.spent exactly: its own cycle by day, unheaded, then one “Paid early · ‹cycle›” section per earlier cycle. Rows carry no envelope tag. Edit, ＋ and every row action close the detail, open their sheet from the Plan lens, and reopen it afterwards while the envelope is still active; delete and swipe act in place. Samples: -seedPlanData travelling (October) and paid-early (November), payday 25.",
