                      "content": "§4.2–§4.4, -seedPlanData travelling. ✕ Close, the envelope's name over the cycle's title, Edit opens the plan item editor (closing this first, reopening it after). The card restates the row: Rp 685.000 spent of Rp 2.000.000, the bar and its legend, the row's violet ＋ (New expense · Move expenses here…), and what it claims. The list is the envelope's own cycle by day, unheaded, with no envelope tag on any row — every row here is in Travelling. Tap edits, long-press offers Move to envelope… / Edit / Delete, swipe deletes.",
