                      "content": "§4.3, §4.4, -seedPlanData paid-early. Opened from T1. The card carries the row's caption. November has no expense of its own in Travelling, so the list starts straight at the first “Paid early · ‹cycle›” section: the ticket, dated 14 Oct, untagged (no dashed tag — the header says it). Several earlier cycles would each get a section, newest first. The section header has no total; the caption is it.",
