                  "id": "xXf9f",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color/text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1300,
                  "content": "Chosen: Option A (owner, 2026-09-25). Tapping a Spend by Category / Spend by Account row pushes one detail screen onto the Insights stack — the Person detail pattern. It is seeded with the page's period chip and payday and can re-scope on its own. It shows: a SpendEntityHeader (entity glyph + tint, total, share of the window), a tappable cross-dimension breakdown (a category's accounts / an account's categories) that narrows the list with a FocusChip, and the window's expenses as PersonDayCards whose rows open the editor. K1–K4 = the flow, K8–K11 = entry and edge states. B and C are kept dimmed for the record. Sample = the All-time seed: Makan Rp 280.000 of Rp 415.000 (67%) = GoPay 155.000 + Cash 80.000 + Unassigned 45.000.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font/family",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
